translate es qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_73773068:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "While we do not know much of their society, much like ours, it seems to be at least somewhat factional."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Aunque no sabemos mucho de su sociedad, al igual que la nuestra, parece ser al menos algo faccionaria."

